{"repositoryId":1190859973,"availability":"available","full":"oluciano/NexJob","name":"NexJob","description":"Background jobs for .NET  Predictable. Observable. No magic. install, implement, run.","category":"Other","language":"C#","stars":13,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-24T17:30:27Z","updated":"2026-10-19T22:11:39Z","license":"MIT","branch":"develop","homepage":"https://oluciano.github.io/NexJob/","topics":["aws-sqs","azure-service-bus","background-jobs","dotnet","hangfire-alternative","kafka","mongodb","opentelemetry","outbox-pattern","postgresql","rabbitmq","redis","salesforce","sql-server"],"demo":"https://nexjob-playground.fly.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:53.834Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:53.834Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:53.834Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T22:19:53.834Z","stars":13,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Background jobs for .NET that survive the worst day.","Retries, dead-letter handling, deadlines and a built-in dashboard.","PostgreSQL · SQL Server · Redis · MongoDB · in-memory."],"features":["The same tests on every provider. One contract suite runs on InMemory, PostgreSQL, SQL Server, Redis and MongoDB.","Several nodes, one database. Reliability scenarios run many workers and nodes on the four databases: each job runs once, no job is lost under concurrent enqueue, and a job left behind by a dead node is recovered and…","A killed process. On SQL Server a node runs in its own process and is killed in the middle of a job.","Upgrades. A storage filled by the previous version opens with the new one, with its history and orphans intact.","An honest list of gaps. The process kill is tested on SQL Server only, and wake-up latency is not asserted. The list is in the page above."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/oluciano/NexJob/blob/develop/README.md","fingerprint":"8b857ea18d27eabf679640984d6293730a35f70d608b526e52f5516d84f26c26","extracte